    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I was running an shiny app to fread google sheet. The script works perfectly under RStudio, but I was unable to run the exact same script under ShinyApps.io<div><br></div><div>CODE</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><div><div>...</div><div>fileURL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format=csv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format%3Dcsv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JbVhzPWiE5XjZP6ibHSkG\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format=csv</a>&quot;</div><div>DF &lt;- fread(fileURL, header=TRUE)</div><div>...</div></div></span></div></code></div><br></div><div>ERROR:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: unsupported URL scheme</pre></div></code></div><div><br></div>I also try <a href=\"http://goo.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0A3uaYHK006_RDUS8VQohD\">goo.gl</a> or <a href=\"http://bit.ly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pOiMXP-UonTg2tkCSkLHJ\">bit.ly</a> to shorten the URL:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div>fileURL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20XhXbwlIQ_2Dj7r9O9Wa_\">http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R</a>&quot;</div><div>fileURL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fWoiBqQdUUOvG5EkN301c\">http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO</a>&quot;</div></div></code></div><br>both did not work on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wxlOH5ahsaIqttixmu9Zd\">shinyapps.io</a>, but work perfectly with RStudio. </div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144030000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fWoiBqQdUUOvG5EkN301c\">http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO</a>&#39;</pre></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Any solution? Thanks in advanced.</div><div><br></div></div>"
