   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Tommy,\r<br>\r<br>Please post the sessionInfo() of your local R environment. My guess is\r<br>that you were using Windows, and have called utils::setInternet2(TRUE)\r<br>somewhere, otherwise the error is entirely expected (HTTPS is not\r<br>directly supported).\r<br>\r<br>When reading https resources, you are recommended to use more portable\r<br>solutions, such as RCurl (or httr), or downloader, to download the\r<br>files first: <a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/downloader/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/downloader/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZGaxuZlfDV7SjFGnrekP0\">http://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/downloader/index.html</a>\r<br>(Note setInternet2() is a Windows-only solution)\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Yihui\r<br>--\r<br>Yihui Xie &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">xiey...@gmail.com</a>&gt;\r<br>Web: <a href=\"http://yihui.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://yihui.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qLJGhLqGkjzEnfZUTwx4_\">http://yihui.name</a>\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "\r<br>\r<br>On Tue, Dec 23, 2014 at 5:41 AM, Tareef Kawaf &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tar...@rstudio.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; I tried running this from my own local RStudio instance and I got the\r<br>&gt; following error:\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; DF &lt;- fread(fileURL, header=TRUE)\r<br>&gt; Error in download.file(input, tt, mode = &quot;wb&quot;) : unsupported URL scheme.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; On Tue, Dec 23, 2014 at 12:21 AM, Tommy Ho &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tommy...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; I was running an shiny app to fread google sheet. The script works\r<br>&gt;&gt; perfectly under RStudio, but I was unable to run the exact same script under\r<br>&gt;&gt; ShinyApps.io\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; CODE\r<br>&gt;&gt; ...\r<br>&gt;&gt; fileURL &lt;-\r<br>&gt;&gt; &quot;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format=csv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format%3Dcsv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_MvzlTwVEpgXHx9kFrq-X\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16m0C8bKmQ2ceytb93vteXHkv_PyH2TPhW5GQQ9DPY54/export?format=csv</a>&quot;\r<br>&gt;&gt; DF &lt;- fread(fileURL, header=TRUE)\r<br>&gt;&gt; ...\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; ERROR:\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; ERROR: unsupported URL scheme\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; I also try <a href=\"http://goo.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qLH7O6BPw9ScpBEDzLpYV\">goo.gl</a> or <a href=\"http://bit.ly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LWo3HIFTD8mzhbQvc3-bL\">bit.ly</a> to shorten the URL:\r<br>&gt;&gt; fileURL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2uhRKvTDr92L4pneiO0jL3\">http://goo.gl/ow1Q6R</a>&quot;\r<br>&gt;&gt; fileURL &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0aPTlg4_d-4Q9s6R8kX0Cm\">http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO</a>&quot;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; both did not work on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1doZb4mOiGeH7yHm5RpXo_\">shinyapps.io</a>, but work perfectly with RStudio.\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; ERROR: cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364144033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0aPTlg4_d-4Q9s6R8kX0Cm\">http://bit.ly/1x5wsRO</a>&#39;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; Any solution? Thanks in advanced.\r<br>"
